1.4 为什么神经网络会流行？(Why is Deep Learning taking off?)
> scale drive deep learning progress:
performance: traditional learning algorithm (e.g., sum, logistic regression...) < small NN < medium NN < large NN 
high level performance need: 1) large neural networks (algorithms), 2) large training sets, 3) large computing power (computation power)
# neural network revolution from sigmoid function to ReLU function, to make gradient descent work faster
sigmoid function (at the region nearly 0, gradient is very small, so gradient descent is very slow)
ReLU function (at the region nearly 0, gradient is very large, so gradient descent is very fast)

