2.2 逻辑回归(Logistic Regression)
> logistic regression: 
given x, want y-hat =P(y=1|x) 
x∈R^(nx), 
parameter w∈R^(nx), b∈R,
# output y-hat=w^T.x+b #计算机代码的写法，和点积z=w.x+b是一样的 （数学写法），work for linear regression, but not for classification, because y-hat can be any real number, but we want y-hat to be between 0 and 1 
output y-hat=sigmoid(z)=1/(1+e^-z) #sigmoid function, work for classification, because y-hat is between 0 and 1, and can be interpreted as a probability
